{"id":"network-tcp","cat":"network","title":"TCP 与 UDP 核心问题","file":"network/tcp.md","authors":["csview-local 示例"],"type":"qa","questions":[{"id":"network-tcp~1","n":1,"title":"TCP 的三次握手过程？","doc":"network-tcp","cat":"network","badges":[{"kind":"key","text":"重要"}],"leetcode":null,"words":383,"html":"<p><img src=\"img/tcp-handshake.svg\" alt=\"TCP 三次握手时序\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"md-img\" data-zoom=\"1\"></p>\n<p>三次握手的目的是<strong>同步双方的初始序列号，并确认双向通路都可用</strong>。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>第一次</strong>：客户端发 <code>SYN=1, seq=x</code>，进入 <code>SYN_SENT</code>。此时客户端只知道自己能发。</li>\n<li><strong>第二次</strong>：服务端回 <code>SYN=1, ACK=1, seq=y, ack=x+1</code>，进入 <code>SYN_RCVD</code>。服务端由此知道「对方能发、自己能收」，并且把自己的初始序列号 <code>y</code> 告诉对方。</li>\n<li><strong>第三次</strong>：客户端发 <code>ACK=1, seq=x+1, ack=y+1</code>，双方进入 <code>ESTABLISHED</code>。服务端收到后才确认「自己能发、对方能收」。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"adm adm-tip\"><div class=\"adm-head\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3v3M12 18v3M3 12h3M18 12h3M5.6 5.6l2.1 2.1M16.3 16.3l2.1 2.1M18.4 5.6l-2.1 2.1M7.7 16.3l-2.1 2.1\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3.2\"/></svg><span>为什么两次不够</span></div><div class=\"adm-body\"><p>两次握手时服务端无法确认客户端的接收能力，也无法确认自己发出的初始序列号被对方收到。更关键的是：一个在网络里滞留很久的旧 <code>SYN</code> 到达服务端后，服务端会直接建立连接并一直等待数据，白白占用资源。第三次握手让客户端有机会用 <code>RST</code> 拒绝这个历史连接。</p>\n</div></div>","toc":[],"freq":6},{"id":"network-tcp~2","n":2,"title":"TCP 为什么挥手要四次？","doc":"network-tcp","cat":"network","badges":[{"kind":"key","text":"重要"}],"leetcode":null,"words":253,"html":"<p>因为 TCP 是<strong>全双工</strong>的，两个方向的数据流要分别关闭。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>客户端发 <code>FIN</code> 只表示「我没有数据要发了」，服务端可能还有数据没传完。</li>\n<li>服务端先回 <code>ACK</code> 确认收到关闭请求，此时客户端到服务端的方向关闭，连接处于<strong>半关闭</strong>状态。</li>\n<li>等服务端把剩余数据发完，才发自己的 <code>FIN</code>。</li>\n<li>客户端回 <code>ACK</code>，并等待 <code>2MSL</code> 后彻底关闭。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>ACK</code> 和 <code>FIN</code> 之所以不能像握手那样合并，就是因为中间这段「服务端还在发数据」的时间不确定。如果服务端恰好没有数据要发，内核也可能把 <code>ACK</code> 和 <code>FIN</code> 合并，出现三次挥手。</p>\n","toc":[],"freq":4},{"id":"network-tcp~3","n":3,"title":"TIME_WAIT 为什么等 2MSL？","doc":"network-tcp","cat":"network","badges":[{"kind":"master","text":"掌握"}],"leetcode":null,"words":328,"html":"<p><code>MSL</code> 是报文最大生存时间，Linux 里通常取 30 秒，所以 <code>TIME_WAIT</code> 常见为 60 秒。等 <code>2MSL</code> 有两个原因：</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>保证最后一个 ACK 能到达</td>\n<td>若这个 <code>ACK</code> 丢了，服务端会重发 <code>FIN</code>。等待期内客户端还能重发 <code>ACK</code>；直接关闭则会回 <code>RST</code>，让服务端异常结束。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>让旧连接的报文自然消亡</td>\n<td>等待 <code>2MSL</code> 后，本次连接产生的所有报文都已在网络中过期，不会串到用相同四元组的新连接里。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><div class=\"adm adm-warning\"><div class=\"adm-head\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10.3 3.9 2.6 17.2A2 2 0 0 0 4.3 20h15.4a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-2.8L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0Z\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4M12 16.6v.4\"/></svg><span>线上常见问题</span></div><div class=\"adm-body\"><p>短连接压测时客户端会堆积大量 <code>TIME_WAIT</code>，耗尽本地端口。解决方向是改用长连接 / 连接池，而不是盲目打开 <code>tcp_tw_reuse</code>；<code>tcp_tw_recycle</code> 在 NAT 环境下会丢连接，且已在新内核中移除。</p>\n</div></div>","toc":[],"freq":3},{"id":"network-tcp~4","n":4,"title":"TCP 和 UDP 的区别？","doc":"network-tcp","cat":"network","badges":[{"kind":"key","text":"重要"}],"leetcode":null,"words":278,"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>连接</strong>：TCP 面向连接，先握手；UDP 无连接，直接发。</li>\n<li><strong>可靠性</strong>：TCP 用序列号、确认应答、超时重传、拥塞控制保证不丢不重不乱序；UDP 尽最大努力交付。</li>\n<li><strong>传输形式</strong>：TCP 是字节流，没有消息边界，因此有粘包问题；UDP 是数据报，一次收发对应一个完整报文。</li>\n<li><strong>开销</strong>：TCP 首部 20~60 字节，UDP 固定 8 字节。</li>\n<li><strong>通信模式</strong>：TCP 只能一对一；UDP 支持一对一、一对多、多对多，可做广播和组播。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选型上，需要完整正确的数据（文件、支付、网页）用 TCP；容忍少量丢失但要求低延迟（音视频、实时游戏状态同步、DNS 查询）用 UDP。</p>\n","toc":[],"freq":5},{"id":"network-tcp~5","n":5,"title":"什么是粘包，怎么解决？","doc":"network-tcp","cat":"network","badges":[{"kind":"master","text":"掌握"}],"leetcode":null,"words":198,"html":"<p>粘包不是 TCP 的 bug，而是<strong>字节流没有消息边界</strong>的必然结果：发送端的 Nagle 算法会合并小包，接收端的缓冲区也可能一次读出多条消息或半条消息。</p>\n<p>三种常见的划分方式：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>固定长度</strong>：每条消息定长，简单但浪费带宽。</li>\n<li><strong>分隔符</strong>：用 <code>\\n</code> 之类的特殊字符切分，需要转义正文里的分隔符，Redis 的 RESP 协议走这条路。</li>\n<li><strong>长度字段</strong>：消息头写明正文长度，先读头再按长度读体，是最通用的做法。</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"codeblock\" data-lang=\"cpp\"><figcaption class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"cb-lang\">C++</span><span class=\"cb-meta\">9 行</span><button class=\"cb-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy aria-label=\"复制代码\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8\"/></svg><span>复制</span></button></figcaption><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light night-owl\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">// 长度前缀 framing：先读 4 字节大端长度，再读正文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">bool</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> readFrame</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#D7DBE0\"> fd</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">std</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">string</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#D7DBE0\"> out</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\"> be</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">    if</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">!</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">readN</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">fd</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">be</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\">4</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">)) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> false</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\"> len</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> ntohl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">be</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">    if</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">len</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> ></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\"> kMaxFrame</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> false</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">   // 防御异常长度导致的巨额分配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">    out</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">resize</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">len</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">    return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\"> len</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> ==</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> ||</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> readN</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">fd</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">out</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">data</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(), </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">len</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>","toc":[],"freq":2},{"id":"network-tcp~6","n":6,"title":"拥塞控制的四个阶段？","doc":"network-tcp","cat":"network","badges":[{"kind":"master","text":"掌握"}],"leetcode":null,"words":331,"html":"<p>拥塞控制解决的是「别把网络压垮」，和流量控制（别把接收方压垮）是两件事。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>慢启动</strong>：<code>cwnd</code> 从 1 个 MSS 开始，每收到一个 ACK 就加 1，整体呈指数增长，直到 <code>ssthresh</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>拥塞避免</strong>：超过 <code>ssthresh</code> 后改为每个 RTT 只加 1，线性试探带宽上限。</li>\n<li><strong>快重传</strong>：收到 3 个重复 ACK 就立刻重传那一个报文，不等超时定时器。</li>\n<li><strong>快恢复</strong>：<code>ssthresh = cwnd / 2</code>，<code>cwnd = ssthresh</code>，直接进入拥塞避免，而不是退回慢启动。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"adm adm-info\"><div class=\"adm-head\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 11v5M12 7.6v.6\"/></svg><span>超时与重复 ACK 的区别</span></div><div class=\"adm-body\"><p>超时重传说明网络可能严重拥塞，<code>cwnd</code> 会被打回 1 重新慢启动；而 3 个重复 ACK 说明后续报文还在到达，只是个别丢包，所以只做温和的减半。</p>\n</div></div>","toc":[],"freq":2}],"words":1771,"intro":""}